+# TLS Verification Policy
+
+TLS certificate verification is enabled in all builds, development builds included, and there is no exception for development. This is reinforced by the project's decision to use https everywhere with no exceptions, so connections, internal hosts among them, are not exempted from https or from certificate verification.
